    "detailed_description": "<strong>Get ready for an all-new challenge in this three-dimensional interpretation of the cult series &quot;That Level Again&quot;.</strong><br><br>&quot;That Level Again 3D&quot; is a bold reimagining of the original concept, inspired by the cult series of games, providing players with the opportunity to experience familiar puzzles in a new dimension.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three-Dimensional Puzzles: Explore the world of &quot;That Level Again&quot; with a new perspective. Each level is presented in a three-dimensional space, adding depth and complexity to the original puzzles.<br></li><li>Unique Mechanics: The game offers unique three-dimensional mechanics and puzzles that will make you think in new ways. Discover new ways to overcome obstacles and achieve goals.<br></li><li>Innovative Approach: A new interpretation of familiar levels will make you reconsider solutions and strategies presented in the original series of games.<br></li><li>Dive into the world of &quot;That Level Again 3D&quot; and experience familiar puzzles in a completely new format. Are you ready for the challenge of three-dimensional levels?</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Get ready for an all-new challenge in this three-dimensional interpretation of the cult series &quot;That Level Again&quot;.</strong><br><br>&quot;That Level Again 3D&quot; is a bold reimagining of the original concept, inspired by the cult series of games, providing players with the opportunity to experience familiar puzzles in a new dimension.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three-Dimensional Puzzles: Explore the world of &quot;That Level Again&quot; with a new perspective. Each level is presented in a three-dimensional space, adding depth and complexity to the original puzzles.<br></li><li>Unique Mechanics: The game offers unique three-dimensional mechanics and puzzles that will make you think in new ways. Discover new ways to overcome obstacles and achieve goals.<br></li><li>Innovative Approach: A new interpretation of familiar levels will make you reconsider solutions and strategies presented in the original series of games.<br></li><li>Dive into the world of &quot;That Level Again 3D&quot; and experience familiar puzzles in a completely new format. Are you ready for the challenge of three-dimensional levels?</li></ul>",
